# Per-Turn Real-Commit Anchors for Import Implementation Plan

> **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development (if subagents available) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.

**Goal:** When a Claude Code transcript records the commits a turn made (`toolUseResult.gitOperation.commit`), anchor that turn's imported checkpoint to the real commit instead of the default-branch head.

**Architecture:** Extends PR #1825 on the same branch (`feat/import-commit-link`, worktree `.worktrees/import-commit-link`) — no new PR. The Claude importer extracts per-turn candidate SHAs during `SplitTurns` (pure parsing, mirrors `modelInRange`). `Run` — which already holds the repo — validates candidates per turn: resolve the (short) sha, require it to be an **ancestor of `LinkCommitSHA`** (the default-branch tip the caller already resolved — ancestry doubles as the reachability check, so `Run` still does no branch-name resolution), pick the **last** valid candidate (the turn's end state), else fall back to `LinkCommitSHA` exactly as today. Same `commit_sha` metadata field, smarter value; zero schema/server change. Server PR 3310's no-backfill assumption is *better* satisfied: real default-branch commits are guaranteed present in `repo_commits`.

**Tech Stack:** Go 1.26, go-git v6.

**Evidence base:** real transcript line shape (verified 2026-07-22): `{"type":"user", ..., "toolUseResult":{..., "gitOperation":{"commit":{"sha":"fe71aa6d8","kind":"committed"},"push":{...}}}}`. SHAs are SHORT (7–10 hex). Only kind `"committed"` observed; collect only that kind. 17 transcript files across local projects carry such records; older transcripts lack them entirely — the fallback path stays load-bearing.

**Commit policy:** one commit on top of the existing branch. Do NOT amend or rebase pushed commits. Do NOT stage anything under docs/superpowers/. After pushing, update the PR #1825 body (via `gh pr edit`) to mention per-turn linking — do not post PR comments.

---

## Chunk 1: All tasks

### Task 1: Extract per-turn commit candidates in the Claude importer

**Files:**
- Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/agentimport/agentimport.go` (Turn struct, ~line 42)
- Modify: `cmd/entire/cli/agentimport/claude.go` (SplitTurns build callback ~line 59; new `commitSHAsInRange` next to `modelInRange` ~line 81)
- Test: `cmd/entire/cli/agentimport/agentimport_test.go`

